WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.016
It was time for Rover's checkup.

2
00:00:05.017 --> 00:00:11.376
But Rover didn't want to go to the vet.

3
00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:15.077
"Come on, Rover!" Mom said.

4
00:00:15.078 --> 00:00:17.957
Emmy pushed and Harry pulled.

5
00:00:17.958 --> 00:00:23.802
But the dog refused to go into the vet's office.

6
00:00:23.803 --> 00:00:28.397
"I know how you feel," Oliver said to Rover.

7
00:00:28.398 --> 00:00:33.644
"I don't like to go to the doctor either."

8
00:00:33.645 --> 00:00:35.890
Oliver looked at Mom.

9
00:00:35.891 --> 00:00:41.631
"Maybe Rover needs a treat," he said.

10
00:00:41.632 --> 00:00:45.009
Soon Rover was sitting in the waiting area.

11
00:00:45.010 --> 00:00:52.258
He paced and panted.

12
00:00:52.259 --> 00:00:56.693
"I know how you feel," Oliver said to the dog.

13
00:00:56.694 --> 00:01:02.655
"Waiting for the doctor makes me nervous too."

14
00:01:02.656 --> 00:01:05.667
Oliver looked at Mom.

15
00:01:05.668 --> 00:01:11.629
"Maybe Rover needs a treat," he said.

16
00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:16.414
Rover and his family went into the examining room.

17
00:01:16.415 --> 00:01:20.396
It was a tight fit!

18
00:01:20.397 --> 00:01:23.691
First the vet weighed Rover.

19
00:01:23.692 --> 00:01:28.663
Next she looked at his eyes, ears, and mouth.

20
00:01:28.664 --> 00:01:34.036
"That's what my doctor does too!" Oliver said to Rover.

21
00:01:34.037 --> 00:01:38.689
The vet listened to Rover's heart and lungs.

22
00:01:38.690 --> 00:01:42.638
"You have a healthy dog!" she said.

23
00:01:42.639 --> 00:01:46.718
"Now it's time for his shots."

24
00:01:46.719 --> 00:01:51.410
"Shots? I hate shots!" Oliver cried.

25
00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:56.408
Oliver dashed under the examining table.

26
00:01:56.409 --> 00:02:00.915
Rover quickly joined him.

27
00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:04.597
The others looked at each other.

28
00:02:04.598 --> 00:02:09.159
"Maybe Rover needs a treat," Harry said.

29
00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:15.322
"Maybe Oliver does too!" Emmy said.

